    {"type":"text","id":"indexer_t","x":190,"y":896,"width":690,"height":110,"text":"C4 Lightning Indexer（GPU）\nQ 派生 index_q [T,64,128]；历史保存轻量 Index Key [L4,128]\nscore(position) = Σ_heads weight × ReLU(index_q · index_k)\n对远程候选排序 → 选 Top-K = 512","originalText":"C4 Lightning Indexer（GPU）\nQ 派生 index_q [T,64,128]；历史保存轻量 Index Key [L4,128]\nscore(position) = Σ_heads weight × ReLU(index_q · index_k)\n对远程候选排序 → 选 Top-K = 512","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#22c55e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":43019,"version":1,"versionNonce":43020,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.3},
