    {"type":"text","id":"memory_note","x":1010,"y":900,"width":600,"height":115,"text":"C4 的“4”表示压缩率，不是只保留 4 个 token。\n例如远程历史 4096 token，约形成 1024 个 C4 表示；\nIndexer 再从这些候选中选最多 512 个。\nSWA 的最近 128 token 仍精确保留，不参与这个压缩。","originalText":"C4 的“4”表示压缩率，不是只保留 4 个 token。\n例如远程历史 4096 token，约形成 1024 个 C4 表示；\nIndexer 再从这些候选中选最多 512 个。\nSWA 的最近 128 token 仍精确保留，不参与这个压缩。","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":43027,"version":1,"versionNonce":43028,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.35},

